Error [jet.DestructureShapeMismatch]: `left` isn't a member of (part0: Int, part1: Int)
  --> tests/ui/tuple_destructure_rename_keeps_written_names.jet:6:6
    |
  6 |     (left, right): pair()
    |      ^^^^
 Why: A tuple destructure binds each member by its name, never by position
 Fix: Name the members, `(part0, part1): …`, or rename them: `{ part0: left, part1: right }: …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0313

Error [jet.DestructureShapeMismatch]: `_0` isn't a member of (part0: Int, part1: Int)
  --> tests/ui/tuple_destructure_rename_keeps_written_names.jet:8:7
    |
  8 |     { _0: first, _1: second }: pair()
    |       ^^
 Why: A tuple destructure binds each member by its name, never by position
 Fix: Name the members, `(part0, part1): …`, or rename them: `{ part0: first, part1: second }: …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0313

Error [jet.DestructureShapeMismatch]: `_0` isn't a member of (part0: Int, part1: Int)
  --> tests/ui/tuple_destructure_rename_keeps_written_names.jet:10:7
    |
 10 |     { _0: value, _1: value }: pair()
    |       ^^
 Why: A tuple destructure binds each member by its name, never by position
 Fix: Name the members, `(part0, part1): …`, or rename them: `{ part0: value, part1: part1 }: …`
