Error [jet.NameAlreadyTaken]: The name `value` is already taken here
  --> tests/ui/tuple_destructure_rename_keeps_written_names.jet:10:22
    |
 10 |     { _0: value, _1: value }: pair()
    |                      ^^^^^
 Why: Inside one function, each name refers to exactly one thing
 Fix: Pick a different name, or assign to the existing one with `value = ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0118
